{"author":"Valdemar1902","authorUid":"WIn1mNvYXGap5UlRvJXYeHahdYl1","remixOf":null,"description":"This build order aims to counter spear openers, so use this against all civs that could potentially go spears against you. The civs I wouldn't open mill against are: French, Golden Horde, JD, Malians, Rus, Sengoku & Delhi.\n\nenjoy!","title":"Hippodrome Mill Opener Into 12 Min Castle","civ":"BYZ","map":null,"season":"Season 13","strategy":"Timing Attack","downvotes":0,"comments":0,"scoreAllTime":0,"isDraft":false,"timeCreated":{"_seconds":1787073534,"_nanoseconds":94000000},"id":"D7Jsk12Fl2FCyiJf7q9L","ageTimings":{"feudal":{"t":240,"e":false},"castle":{"t":744,"e":true}},"steps":[{"age":1,"gameplan":"","steps":[{"description":"Starting 6 <img src=\"/assets/pictures/unit_worker/villager.webp\" class=\"icon-default\" /> go to <img src=\"/assets/pictures/building_economy/mill.webp\" class=\"icon-default\" title=\"Mill\" /><img src=\"/assets/pictures/resource/berrybush.webp\" class=\"icon-none\" /> &amp; 1 of them builds <img src=\"/assets/pictures/building_byzantines/cistern-1.webp\" class=\"icon-default\" title=\"Cistern\" /> &amp; <img src=\"/assets/pictures/building_economy/house.webp\" class=\"icon-default\" title=\"House\" /> ","builders":"","gold":"","stone":"","time":"0:00","wood":"","_id":1787073860384,"food":"6"},{"_id":1787073860385,"gameplan":"Remember to build your buildings inside TC Range. AND IMPORTANT: Gather outside berries first, as you want to shift unto the inside berries after enemy spears arrive. Otherwise, you cannot afford longbows in feudal.","description":""},{"time":"0:20","_id":1787073860386,"stone":"","wood":"","food":"6","villagers":"","description":"<img src=\"/assets/pictures/resource/rally.webp\" class=\"icon-none\" title=\"Rally\" /> next 2 <img src=\"/assets/pictures/unit_worker/villager.webp\" class=\"icon-default\" /> to <img src=\"/assets/pictures/building_economy/mining-camp.webp\" class=\"icon-default\" /><img src=\"/assets/pictures/resource/resource_gold.webp\" class=\"icon-none\" title=\"Gold\" />","gold":"1","builders":""},{"stone":"","wood":"","description":"<img src=\"/assets/pictures/resource/rally.webp\" class=\"icon-none\" /> to <img src=\"/assets/pictures/resource/sheep.webp\" class=\"icon-none\" title=\"Sheep\" /> under <img src=\"/assets/pictures/building_economy/town-center.webp\" class=\"icon-default\" title=\"Town Center\" />","food":"7","time":"1:00","builders":"","villagers":"","gold":"2","_id":1787073860387}],"type":"age"},{"gameplan":"","age":1,"steps":[{"gold":"2","time":"2:37","_id":1787073860388,"description":"Now take 5 <img src=\"/assets/pictures/resource/sheep.webp\" class=\"icon-none\" title=\"Sheep\" /><img src=\"https://aoe4guides.com/assets/pictures/unit_worker/villager.webp\" class=\"icon-default\" /> and build <img src=\"/assets/pictures/landmark_byzantines/imperial-hippodrome-1.webp\" class=\"icon-landmark\" title=\"Imperial Hippodrome\" />","food":"11"},{"gold":"","food":"6","villagers":"","wood":"3","builders":"5","description":"<img src=\"/assets/pictures/resource/rally.webp\" class=\"icon-none\" title=\"Rally\" /><img src=\"/assets/pictures/resource/gaiatreeprototypetree.webp\" class=\"icon-none\" title=\"Straggler Tree\" /> &amp; take <img src=\"/assets/pictures/resource/resource_gold.webp\" class=\"icon-none\" /><img src=\"/assets/pictures/unit_worker/villager.webp\" class=\"icon-default\" /> to <img src=\"/assets/pictures/resource/gaiatreeprototypetree.webp\" class=\"icon-none\" /> as well after you bank 35 gold for <img src=\"/assets/pictures/unit_byzantines/limitanei-1.webp\" class=\"icon-military\" /> upgrade.","stone":"","_id":1787073860389,"time":"2:40"}],"type":"ageUp"},{"gameplan":"","age":2,"type":"age","steps":[{"wood":"7","food":"11","description":"Make <img src=\"/assets/pictures/unit_cavalry/horseman-1.webp\" class=\"icon-military\" /> &amp; build a <img src=\"/assets/pictures/building_byzantines/mercenary-house-2.webp\" class=\"icon-military\" /> &amp; <img src=\"/assets/pictures/building_economy/lumber-camp.webp\" class=\"icon-default\" title=\"Lumber Camp\" /> &amp; <img src=\"/assets/pictures/building_economy/house.webp\" class=\"icon-default\" />","time":"4:00","_id":1787072667610},{"gameplan":"When <img src=\"/assets/pictures/building_byzantines/mercenary-house-2.webp\" class=\"icon-military\" title=\"Mercenary House\"> is finished queue <img src=\"/assets/pictures/technology_byzantines/western-mercenary-contract-1.webp\" class=\"icon-tech\" title=\"Western Mercenary Contract\"> and then <img src=\"/assets/pictures/unit_byzantines/longbowman-2.webp\" class=\"icon-military\" title=\"Longbowman\"> after. Make a <img src=\"/assets/pictures/building_military/barracks.webp\" class=\"icon-military\" title=\"Barracks\"> when possible","_id":1787072667611,"description":""},{"builders":"","gold":"","_id":1787072667612,"stone":"","time":"4:50","food":"12","description":"Once you have 8 <img src=\"/assets/pictures/unit_worker/villager.webp\" class=\"icon-default\" /> on <img src=\"/assets/pictures/resource/resource_wood.webp\" class=\"icon-none\" title=\"Wood\" /> start <img src=\"/assets/pictures/resource/rally.webp\" class=\"icon-none\" /> unto <img src=\"/assets/pictures/resource/sheep.webp\" class=\"icon-none\" /> until 12-14 and then 4 on <img src=\"/assets/pictures/resource/resource_gold.webp\" class=\"icon-none\" />","wood":"8","villagers":""},{"gameplan":"For now, stay in your base, and start securing 2nd and 3rd berries after each other with your infantry units, while your horsemen are raiding. If your opponent is playing greedy like FC or 2TC, then you pull infantry fwd and make <img src=\"/assets/pictures/unit_byzantines/cheirosiphon-3.webp\" class=\"icon-military\" title=\"Cheirosiphon\"> and find timing. If they are playing 1tc aggression, then you just focus on making units and aging to castle at 12 mins.","_id":1787072667613,"description":""},{"gold":"1","_id":1787072667614,"builders":"1","stone":"","time":"5:25","villagers":"","description":"<img src=\"/assets/pictures/building_military/barracks.webp\" class=\"icon-military\" />","food":"13","wood":"7"},{"villagers":"","wood":"8","food":"13","builders":"","time":"6:00","stone":"","description":"2nd <img src=\"/assets/pictures/building_byzantines/cistern-1.webp\" class=\"icon-default\" title=\"Cistern\" />","gold":"2","_id":1787072667615},{"villagers":"","gold":"4","stone":"","description":"<img src=\"/assets/pictures/building_technology/blacksmith.webp\" class=\"icon-tech\" title=\"Blacksmith\" /> and queue <img src=\"/assets/pictures/technology_military/steeled-arrow.webp\" class=\"icon-tech\" title=\"Steeled Arrow\" /><img src=\"/assets/pictures/technology_military/iron-undermesh.webp\" class=\"icon-tech\" />","builders":"","wood":"8","food":"15","_id":1787072667616,"time":"7:30"},{"_id":1787072667617,"gold":"4","builders":"","villagers":"","description":"2nd <img src=\"/assets/pictures/unit_byzantines/longbowman-2.webp\" class=\"icon-military\" title=\"Longbowman\" /> &amp; take 2nd <img src=\"/assets/pictures/resource/berrybush.webp\" class=\"icon-none\" /> with 5 <img src=\"/assets/pictures/unit_worker/villager.webp\" class=\"icon-default\" /> and an  <img src=\"/assets/pictures/building_defensive/outpost.webp\" class=\"icon-default\" />+<img src=\"/assets/pictures/building_economy/mill.webp\" class=\"icon-default\" />","stone":"","time":"8:00","food":"17","wood":"8"},{"stone":"","wood":"8","food":"19","builders":"","time":"9:30","villagers":"","description":"3rd <img src=\"/assets/pictures/resource/berrybush.webp\" class=\"icon-none\" /> and <img src=\"/assets/pictures/technology_economy/wheelbarrow.webp\" class=\"icon-tech\" />","gold":"4","_id":1787072667618},{"_id":1787072667619,"description":"","gameplan":"Every time you secure a resource, do it with 5 <img src=\"/assets/pictures/unit_worker/villager.webp\" class=\"icon-default\" title=\"Villager\"> and build an <img src=\"/assets/pictures/building_defensive/outpost.webp\" class=\"icon-default\"> to house all of them in case of raids to buy you time to respond. Think of <img src=\"/assets/pictures/building_defensive/outpost.webp\" class=\"icon-default\" title=\"Outpost\"> as delays, that give you time to defend with units."},{"description":"11 mins in you stop making units and macro towards castle age with 2-3 on wood and rest on food and gold","gold":"12","stone":"","_id":1787072667620,"time":"11:00","builders":"","villagers":"","wood":"3","food":"23"}]},{"gameplan":"","age":2,"type":"ageUp","steps":[{"_id":1787072667622,"time":"","gold":"15","food":"23","description":"Build  <img src=\"https://aoe4guides.com/assets/pictures/landmark_byzantines/golden-horn-tower-2.webp\" class=\"icon-landmark\" /> with 8-12 vills and <img src=\"https://aoe4guides.com/assets/pictures/building_military/stable.webp\" class=\"icon-military\" />. Keep gathering wood for <img src=\"https://aoe4guides.com/assets/pictures/building_religious/monastery.webp\" class=\"icon-default\" /> and then start making <img src=\"https://aoe4guides.com/assets/pictures/unit_byzantines/cataphract-3.webp\" class=\"icon-military\" /> + <img src=\"https://aoe4guides.com/assets/pictures/unit_byzantines/longbowman-2.webp\" class=\"icon-military\" title=\"Longbowman\" /> and take <img src=\"https://aoe4guides.com/assets/pictures/resource/relics.webp\" class=\"icon-none\" />. This is also crucial timing for attack since your upgrades come in very rapidly with Byz cistern scaling, so find dmg! GL!","wood":"3"}]},{"type":"age","gameplan":"","steps":[{"description":"","_id":1787072667623}],"age":3}],"sortTitle":"hippodrome mill opener into 12 min castleb98dae04-b18a-4590-bbc4-83f035be1b96","timeUpdated":{"_seconds":1787074959,"_nanoseconds":957000000},"creatorId":"UCyzgM7IMV8AXN8suRSyNhiQ","creatorName":"Valdemar","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/0pkvLN16f4o","upvotes":1,"score":4.574710978503383,"likes":1,"views":172}